* **Important PPA Trade-offs at RTL:**

| RTL Optimization | Power | Performance | Area |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| Reduce data width | ↓ | Can improve | ↓ |
| Reduce logic depth | ↓/↔ | ↑ | ↓/↔ |
| Add pipeline stages | ↑/↔ | ↑ | ↑ |
| Hardware sharing | ↓/↔ | ↓/↔ | ↓ |
| Parallel hardware | ↑ | ↑ | ↑ |
| Reduce switching | ↓ | ↔ | ↔ |
| Clock gating | ↓ | ↔ | ↑/↔ |
| Reduce registers | ↓ | ↓/↔ | ↓ |
| Larger/faster hardware | ↑ | ↑ | ↑ |
| Reduce mux complexity | ↓/↔ | ↑ | ↓/↔ |

The exact effect depends on the architecture, technology, synthesis tool, and constraints.

