* **Practical RTL PPA Optimization Flow:**

```text
1. Understand Specification
          ↓
2. Identify PPA Requirements
          ↓
3. Design Initial Architecture
          ↓
4. Write Synthesizable RTL
          ↓
5. Verify Functionality
          ↓
6. Synthesize
          ↓
7. Check Timing
          ↓
8. Check Area
          ↓
9. Check Power
          ↓
10. Identify Main Bottleneck
          ↓
11. Optimize RTL
          ↓
12. Re-Synthesize
          ↓
13. Compare Results
          ↓
14. Verify Again
          ↓
15. Continue Until Requirements Are Met
```

